      <div type="clause" n="13">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 13</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be burga gebettunge.] [Ld] Ond we cwæðaþ, ðæt ælc burh sy gebet XIIII niht ofer gongdagas.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And we declare that every fortress shall be repaired by a fortnight after Rogation days.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Be burga gebettunge. We cwædon, þæt ælc burgh sy gebet feowertyne niht ofer gangdagas.</ab>
      </div>
